# Normalize line endings to LF for text files regardless of platform --
# found live: Windows core.autocrlf checking files out as CRLF broke
# Release-ToPublic.ps1's `git apply` (patch context is generated from LF
# blob content via `git diff`/`git show`, but applies against the actual
# CRLF working-tree files in the script's scratch clone) even though the
# underlying content was identical. Binary assets are left untouched by
# `text=auto`'s own detection, no separate binary list needed.
* text=auto eol=lf
